WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:07.720
Holding on tight to the dream
that shines and sparkles,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.220
~~ Naru ~~
Holding on tight to the dream
that shines and sparkles,

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.720
~~ Naru ~~
let's walk towards tomorrow
one step at a time.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:15.310
let's walk towards tomorrow
one step at a time.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:24.800
Oh, through this
luminous city,

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:31.000
oh, I run while greeting
everyone with a smile.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:38.880
Even if the wind that blows
in my face is really cold,

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.640
I kick it away and jump
past it with a burst of energy.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:52.790
Holding on tight to this moment
that shines and sparkles,

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:57.130
everything is a
precious treasure!

00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:01.830
The sun that shines
down on hope...

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:04.960
...is always in my heart.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:12.040
Let's walk towards tomorrow
one step at a time.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:41.260
Long time no see, Kei!

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:45.270
Moe! Wow, how could I
have forgotten about you?

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:52.050
Wow, I haven't had
<i>this</i> dream in a while...

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:54.220
Oh, okay.
This is a dream.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:57.620
Did you know?

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:05.130
Did you know?

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:09.030
They say that when a couple goes into
that annex, they'll stay together forever.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.340
We'll go in together
someday, okay?

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:14.400
Then you won't
be lonely anymore.

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.880
It's a... promise.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:22.110
Promise me, big brother.

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:29.780
That didn't seem like the
same dream as usual...

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.560
Where is this place?

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.570
Where are we?

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.050
N-No....

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.020
No!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.100
Don't worry.
It's right here.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:27.510
Why did I dream
about Moe...?

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:29.970
It's gone!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:31.910
It's gone!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.050
Gone!

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:35.920
I-It's not here!

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:38.280
I-It's not here!
It's gone!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:40.520
Good morning, Narusegawa.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.360
G-Good morning.
What is it?

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.130
Y'know, about last night...
There was a ring that I--

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:47.160
A ring?

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:49.500
Wh-What ring?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.130
Well, so much happened
that it's kinda fuzzy,

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:54.540
but I'm pretty sure
I gave you a ring...

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:57.040
Really? You did?

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.780
You <i>lost</i> it, didn't you?

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.910
I can't believe this woman.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:04.680
If it were me, I would never
let it leave my finger.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:08.750
Manager:
Keitaro Urashima

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.770
Uh... how about some tea?

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:24.940
Or some snacks?

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.330
Su?!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.680
Hey, you two...

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:51.090
I can't believe that I can't
even get <i>near</i> them.

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:55.900
Oh my gosh! Is this the magic power
of the abandoned annex?

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.600
What's that?

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.640
It can't be... How could
it have gotten up there?

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:07.540
That has to be it!

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:21.490
Everybody's turning into
shooting stars!

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.930
I'm sorry, Miss Naru.

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.670
I've been feeling strange
since this morning.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:35.800
You too, Motoko?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.570
Don't tell me this is also the
power of the abandoned annex...

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.890
Ms. Naru!

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.350
Y-Yes?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.890
I have something to tell you.

00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:59.500
I, as well.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.540
W-Why are you all here?

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:11.200
Oh, don't worry about us.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.970
This <i>is</i> a serious matter affecting
all of Hinata Apartments, after all.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:15.810
- Miss Naru.
- Y-Yes?

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.540
Why do you
let her do this?

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:19.710
We mean Kanako.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:22.890
She doesn't act like
Mr. Urashima's little sister.

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:25.650
It's almost as if they're... they're...

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.850
All lovey-dovey!

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.430
Miss Naru, I intend to apply
for Tokyo U next year.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:35.330
M-Me, too!
I mean, three years from now.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:36.330
Me, too!

00:06:36.570 --> 00:06:37.540
You are?

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:43.370
If we <i>do</i> manage to get into Tokyo U, we'd
find happiness there with Mr. Urashima.

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.440
Is that something
that's okay with you?

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:49.440
Well, that's supposed
to be a promise between--

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.710
Naru, you <i>told</i> me!

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:54.880
Tell everyone how
you really feel!

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:58.410
Tell everyone right now,
out loud!

00:06:58.890 --> 00:06:59.990
Uh, no...

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:04.060
I mean, that was just... a mistake,
I guess you could say.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.970
Miss Naru!
Tell us the truth!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:11.470
How do you really feel
about Urashima?

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:15.540
C'mon, guys... let's not do this.
Not in front of everybody.

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:19.540
I... I want to know.
I think <i>everybody</i> here wants to!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.050
My, this sounds fascinating.

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.490
Kanako!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.850
How long have you
been here?!

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:32.190
Brother and I were enjoying some quality
time alone, and you interrupted <i>us.</i>

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:34.160
Keitaro!

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.860
Hey, you're gonna kill him...

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:41.700
Stop messing around, Kanako!
Hey, why's everybody--

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:52.650
This is a perfect opportunity. Please
answer her right here and now, Naru.

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:56.120
Wh-What's up with you guys?
You're all looking so serious.

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:59.850
Oh, come on... It's not
like I have a thing for--

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:00.910
Not <i>that</i> again.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.650
Please say it, Naru!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.720
A thing for <i>who?</i>

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:08.630
I... That is, I...

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:19.960
I think I'm in...
I think Keitaro is...

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.380
She bolted!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.550
<i>Why am I running away?</i>

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:41.890
<i>Right, when push comes to shove,</i>
<i>I always dodge the question...</i>

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.760
<i>It's almost as if I...</i>

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:47.030
Narusegawa, what's the matter?!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.660
Let me go, Keitaro!
I'm not the one you--

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:08.420
Big brother, are you all right?

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:09.750
Big brother!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:26.100
Big brother...

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.600
Naru... segawa...

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:44.680
<i>I thought I'd figured out</i>
<i>what he sees in her,</i>

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:50.030
<i>but how can she be so indecisive</i>
<i>when he holds her so dear?</i>

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:55.230
<i>All right, then.</i>
<i>I'll</i> make <i>her decide!</i>

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.620
Wow, this is beautiful!

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.870
I only wish that--

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:28.060
Urashima was here to
share it with you. Right?

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:31.400
I didn't say <i>that!</i>

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.870
Why did you run
away from him?

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:48.520
Hey... Kentaro, have you ever fallen in love
with someone that a friend liked, too?

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:52.580
I don't know.
Why?

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:56.620
You want your friends
to be your friends for life,

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.360
but then once you start dating someone
and end up falling in love with that person,

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:04.090
you can't have the same kind
of friendship with them anymore.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.530
Being in love
sure is rough.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:13.110
There are so many things to worry about.
When you think about it, it's scary.

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.650
Scary?

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.670
If Keitaro and
I became a couple,

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.580
I couldn't face
Shinobu or Motoko.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:24.020
I might not be able to talk
to Kitsune or Su, either.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.660
No, it's not just that.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:30.350
I've always had so much fun
doing silly stuff with Keitaro,

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:33.260
but if we ever
became a couple,

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:37.370
we may not be able to have
the same kind of fun anymore.

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:41.100
So, are you saying that it's okay if
Urashima decided to go out with Kanako?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:44.440
I'd <i>die</i> before I ever
let that happen.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.450
Well, that proves that you're
in love with Urashima.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:51.710
Still, when I picture myself as
the girlfriend of a pervert like him...

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:54.210
So, it's okay as long as
you don't fool around with him?

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:59.350
Well, I'm not saying <i>that.</i>
Every once in a while might be nice, but...

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:02.060
Would you just...

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:03.530
...give it a rest?!

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:05.830
Kanako?!

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:09.330
Make up your mind,
you indecisive woman!

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:12.240
Look who's talking, you sicko
with a crush on your own brother!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.510
The things you say
make no sense at all!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:19.000
That's why Shinobu and Motoko
are so frustrated at you!

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.670
You don't have to
tell <i>me</i> that!

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:23.950
It's <i>my</i> problem, not yours!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:27.410
I just can't leave it alone!
You make me so <i>angry!</i>

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:28.750
I can't help it!

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:30.550
What if...

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:33.320
What if they hate me?

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:37.550
I'd go back to being the
child that nobody loves!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:42.290
You'd be loved by my big brother...
Isn't that enough?

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.300
Hey!

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:53.470
Hey! Urashima!

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:57.850
In that case...

00:12:58.090 --> 00:12:59.680
I'll steal him
away from you!

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:11.760
Narusegawa?

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:14.290
H-Hey!

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.790
Stay away!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.230
Wait!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:18.660
Huh? What the--?

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:28.210
No... No...

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.550
I don't want it
to be like this!

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.450
Hey! Wait up!

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:38.820
Don't follow me!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.760
<i>Big brother is running after me.</i>
<i>Look at how desperate he is.</i>

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.690
<i>Is the magic power of the</i>
<i>annex doing this, too?</i>

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:53.510
<i>No, that's not true.</i>
<i>Big brother thinks he's running after Naru!</i>

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.310
<i>I won't be held responsible</i>
<i>for what happens, Naru.</i>

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:02.440
<i>If he catches me, I'll...</i>

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.670
Hey!

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:11.090
Wait up, darn it!
I have something to tell you!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.030
Why did I come <i>here?</i>

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:26.800
Finally caught you.

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.840
What are you doing, Keitaro?
Let go of me!

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.610
Hey, it's not like that!

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:37.210
I still haven't told you how
I feel about you, right?

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.150
I already know
all about it!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:43.050
You have a huge crush on me, right?
You're head over heels in love!

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:45.020
You're wrong.

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:52.500
Uh... Look, Kanako, I'm sorry for forgetting
about our annex promise all these years.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.660
C'mon, take off that disguise.

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:02.740
Big brother, you came after me when
you knew it was me all along?

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:05.040
Yeah, sure.
Hey, there's still some on your face.

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:08.280
I can do that myself,
big brother.

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.140
Thanks, Kanako.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.480
I bet Narusegawa was
being stubborn again.

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:17.650
You've always been
caring like that.

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.920
That's what I liked
about you.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.000
Big brother...

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:58.360
Someone... must be trying to defy
the abandoned annex's spell.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.100
Will it hold?

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:06.130
H-Hey, aren't you
gonna do anything?

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:08.430
Naru?

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:39.300
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:41.470
What are <i>you</i> guys
doing here?

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:45.840
Oh, you're finally here! If you're looking
for Keitaro, he's on the top floor.

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.840
Keitaro is here?

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.080
Oh, you didn't know?

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:54.880
It looks like we've all been called
here to the abandoned annex...

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:58.110
...to defend Keitaro
and Kanako.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:01.030
It's set up so we can't
move from this spot,

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.620
so we decided to have
a little drinking contest.

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.830
Like you don't
do that every day!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.230
Let me through.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:11.140
I have to go
get my ring back.

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:13.040
Oh, yeah?

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:15.440
We have every right to keep
you from going in, y'know?

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:19.240
You're absolutely right.
After all, I was dumped by Keitaro.

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.340
I, on the other hand, have been your
counselor since we were kids.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.950
I can't count how many times
I had to give up on guys...

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:28.980
...just because they were more
interested in you than in me.

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:30.750
Oh, really?

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:32.590
Yeah, sorta...

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:36.720
But love isn't always pretty.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:39.730
It's sometimes messy,
nasty and sticky.

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:43.630
I never wanted it
to be like that.

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:46.330
I know, I don't like it, either.

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.370
What am I supposed
to do, then?

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:50.330
Beats me.

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:04.980
Thanks.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.840
Oh, dear...

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:28.710
Sorry we couldn't
help you out.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.310
You should've known better than
to get <i>us</i> to do your dirty work.

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.860
I won't let you take one single
step out of this room!

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:58.010
Yes, run!
Run!

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:07.850
No, not this time.

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:10.290
If I ran away now, I'd just
be doing what I always do.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:16.280
I'll <i>get</i> dirty,
nasty, and sticky.

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:21.160
Because I won't let anyone
else have Keitaro!

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:27.130
I-I'm sorry!

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:28.800
It's okay!

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:31.540
<i>That's</i> the Miss Naru I respect.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.480
Motoko?

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:46.490
Now!

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:47.580
Thank you!

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:01.510
When you first came to my house,
you were always crying.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:05.940
Then you finally told me,
and only me, the reason why.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:09.380
You said you were scared
that everybody would leave.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:14.620
That everyone would leave you one day,
just like your mom and dad had left you.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:19.250
And just then, we heard about this
abandoned annex from Granny.

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:23.260
When you're a kid, ""being together forever""
doesn't have any real meaning.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:29.200
I thought you
had kept our promise.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.400
I'm so sorry!
I forgot all about it!

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:35.140
But even without the annex promise,
we'll always be together,

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:38.280
Understand? We'll always be together,
'cause you'll always be a little sister to me.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:43.010
But the one you really wanted
to be with was Naru...

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:52.650
Naru, I've always felt
bad about myself.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:56.760
But living here, I've finally
started to like myself.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:21:01.770
That's why I have to have
Mr. Urashima with me!

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.130
That's not true.

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:04.430
Yes, it is!

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:08.470
Shinobu, you're a good girl,
and you always have been.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:15.540
No fair... That's not fair,
saying things like that...

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:19.780
I'm sorry, I guess it wasn't fair.
I was a coward.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:23.820
I was always jealous when
you and Keitaro flirted.

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:28.320
There were all those times I walked in
on the two of you when you were studying!

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:32.100
I went out on dates with Keitaro, even
though I knew how you felt about him.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:33.590
S-So did I!

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:35.230
Really, when?

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:36.570
I'm not telling!

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.110
Well, I guess we
have other choice.

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:47.310
Nope!

00:21:47.350 --> 00:21:48.780
Let's play Rock, Paper,
Scissors for him.

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:50.110
Right!

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.680
One! Two!

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:59.790
But to me, she's a...

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:03.630
She's a special--

00:22:12.070 --> 00:22:15.060
Just this once,
I'll let you go...

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:17.640
...with a kiss.

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:19.570
Three!

00:22:20.850 --> 00:22:21.810
I lose.

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:25.050
Shinobu, you <i>let</i> me win...!

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:29.050
Naru!

00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:30.860
Hurry, please go.

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:41.360
Narusegawa...

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:47.110
L-Listen, I came to get the ring.

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:53.110
And then... I thought maybe you
could try that profession again.

00:23:01.520 --> 00:23:02.510
Narusegawa!

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:24.670
<i>Why?</i>

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:29.910
<i>That ring!</i>
<i>If I had that ring, maybe...</i>

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:01.240
Found it!

00:24:11.720 --> 00:24:12.620
Keitaro!

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:19.320
<i>I'll be honest with myself...</i>

00:24:20.100 --> 00:24:22.090
So please
don't leave me!

00:24:22.500 --> 00:24:25.700
Keitaro, I love you!

00:25:03.110 --> 00:25:05.040
Naru, you finally found it.

00:25:08.450 --> 00:25:11.610
She was one of the
promise girls, too.

00:25:13.950 --> 00:25:15.480
Ow ow ow...

00:25:15.760 --> 00:25:17.350
Don't be so rough, okay?

00:25:19.130 --> 00:25:21.120
Hey... Narusegawa?

00:25:21.390 --> 00:25:22.880
I love you.

00:25:23.300 --> 00:25:25.060
I love you, I love you,
I love you!

00:25:25.100 --> 00:25:27.120
I'm in love with you, all right?!
So sue me!

00:25:27.800 --> 00:25:30.430
I may not be the girl your promise
was with, but I love you, okay?

00:25:30.740 --> 00:25:34.170
I love you! I love you!
I love you so much!

00:25:36.280 --> 00:25:37.330
I love you.

00:25:40.450 --> 00:25:41.440
Thanks.

00:25:42.880 --> 00:25:44.820
Um, this is for you.

00:26:01.070 --> 00:26:03.190
Wow, that's a grownup kiss...
Nice!

00:26:04.440 --> 00:26:05.400
Guys?!

00:26:06.010 --> 00:26:08.530
This is something that will be
rather difficult to accept...

00:26:08.880 --> 00:26:12.150
Mr. Urashima and Naru
are k-k-kissing?

00:26:12.150 --> 00:26:13.700
How <i>dare</i> you...!

00:26:16.580 --> 00:26:17.910
- Let's get out of here!
- Let's get out of here!

00:26:17.950 --> 00:26:19.280
Come back here!

00:26:22.860 --> 00:26:26.790
Narusegawa!

00:26:29.900 --> 00:26:30.660
Mr. Seta?!

00:26:30.700 --> 00:26:34.000
I just found some fascinating ruins.
I want you to help out.

00:26:37.200 --> 00:26:38.100
Tama?

00:26:44.240 --> 00:26:44.940
Kuro!

00:26:47.450 --> 00:26:48.440
Me, too!

00:26:48.980 --> 00:26:50.570
- And me!
- Wait!

00:26:50.880 --> 00:26:52.480
Let go of me!

00:26:59.230 --> 00:27:01.130
So, where are we headed,
Mr. Seta?

00:27:01.390 --> 00:27:03.620
What do you mean, <i>where?</i>
We can go <i>anywhere.</i>

00:27:04.430 --> 00:27:05.120
Right?

00:27:05.830 --> 00:27:08.430
Then there's a place
I want to go to first.

00:27:11.070 --> 00:27:12.770
- Take this couple in love...
- Take this couple in love...

00:27:13.210 --> 00:27:14.640
- ...to Tokyo U!
- ...to Tokyo U!

00:27:15.270 --> 00:27:16.760
Oh, give me a break.

00:27:38.430 --> 00:27:42.630
Karakara kawaiteiru mune no naka.
Inside of me is dry, bone dry.

00:27:42.670 --> 00:27:47.260
Futo tachidomari ki ga tsuita kara.
I came to a stop and suddenly realized it.

00:27:47.470 --> 00:27:51.670
Daremoga isoideiru machi no naka,
In this city where everyone is rushing about,

00:27:51.710 --> 00:27:56.120
sukoshi yukkuri aruite mita.
I tried walking a little more slowly.

00:27:56.120 --> 00:28:01.250
Koe ni dasanai negai,
When there's a wish I can't voice,

00:28:01.250 --> 00:28:08.820
me wo tojite kou omouno, ""Try!""
I close my eyes and say to myself, ""Try!""

00:28:08.860 --> 00:28:13.420
Dakedo anata ga iru, ai wo motomete iru.
But you're here, you're longing for love.

00:28:13.470 --> 00:28:17.840
Donna toki mo kokoro wa aruyo, sobani.
Come what may, your heart is with you.

00:28:17.870 --> 00:28:22.740
Dakara watashi ga iru, ai wo sagashite iru.
That's why I'm here, I'm searching for love.

00:28:22.940 --> 00:28:25.240
Futari nara,
With the two of us,

00:28:25.240 --> 00:28:29.910
yasashii namida ni kawaru,
I'm sure it will turn into tears of kindness,

00:28:30.120 --> 00:28:34.140
yume wa kitto kanau.
and our dreams will come true.
